uce the chance of a bad guy being caught -- being convicted, being incarcerated, crime goes up. They may be criminals but they're not stupid.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: You know, we showed this video earlier in the program, Tre. Hunter Biden naked -- we're told, I read one report said it's a hooker, we can't confirm that. But with a woman and he's got his gun out and I'm listening to \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  lecture the country about guns and I'm thinking, for god's sake, Joe -- to use his words -- why don't you get your son to handle firearm a little bit more safely, and maybe you shouldn't be putting the fire on in a dumpster near a school. How come he's not in jail?\par \par \uc2 PENNIE: Yeah, absolutely, absolutely.\par \par \uc2 The gun issue is a political football, Sean. All they want to use to try to -- they want to use the gun issue to ride it all the way through the election. But let me go and give you some facts about these guns, right, last year, there were 693 mass shootings. We had 220 mass shootings right now in America.\par \par \uc2 And guess what? The Democrats claim to be the champion of the people, of the inner city and guess what all these shootings are happening at? They're happening in the inner city where all of our black and minority people are being killed.\par \par \uc2 So that -- if the Democrats really want to do something about the people, they should get there and do something about the gangs and let these violent offenders out on our streets to victimize our community over and over again.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: And by the way, we have the big you know theater on on Thursday night about January 6th. What about the 574 riots in the summer of 2020? Well -- I'd like to see that committee come up one day, but I won't hold my breath. Larry, thank you. Tre, thank you.\par \par \uc2 When we come back, Kevin McCarthy calling out the January 6 Committee for their obvious political stunt. We'll show you what he said. We'll get reaction. Laura Trump, Joe 