 Barnett winning.\par \par \uc2 Now, it could be our only chance. We have to get this right. The next two years to stop Biden's radical climate alarmist religious cult agenda new green deal agenda.\par \par \uc2 Look at this, wholesale prices now 11 percent, a new 40-year high. Even fake news CNN reporting that Americans now are skipping meals, racking up debt, 66 percent of American families living paycheck to paycheck. Gas prices all week long hitting one new record high after another.\par \par \uc2 And you know how Joe responded, he canceled yet another massive oil and gas lease in Alaska and one in the Gulf of Mexico, genius that he is. I guess he's going to go back and make an Iranian deal, a Venezuelan deal, beg OPEC to produce energy when we have our own energy.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, in response to the nationwide baby formula shortage, circle back final day \uc2 Jen Psaki\uc2  suggested that worried parents call a doctor. What's a doctor going to do? Where does a doctor have baby formula? What a dumb answer. Listen.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 REPORTER: Since you said it was a public health questions, which agency should that question be directed, to just the very practical immediate question of if you can't find formula and you need it for your baby to eat, what should they be doing?\par \par \uc2 JEN PSAKI\uc2 , WHITE HOUSE PRESS SECRETARY: I mean, we would certainly encourage any parent who has concerns about their child's health or well- being to call their doctor a pediatrician.\par \par \uc2 REPORTER: When was the first time the president was briefed on the shortage?\par \par \uc2 PSAKI: I'm not going to get into internal briefings. He's been made aware of it through the process, and there's been steps. It would have been.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: All right. According to \uc2 Jen Psaki\uc2 , the only real problem the country is facing is something called Ultra MAGA conservatives? New words, and they all