r the party and conservatives to show young people, people of color, people that let me get necessarily always your voters what the effect of \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  really is.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Mark, let's get your take on all this.\par \par \uc2 MARK MEADOWS\uc2 , FORMER WHITE HOUSE CHIEF OF STAFF: Yeah, I think probably the biggest thing that American people are looking at right now is the progressive left and moderate \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  uh has been turned into a progressive left leaning president and it's affecting them at their -- you know, at the pumps.\par \par \uc2 It's a -- you know, I have we have some good friends who adopted a child had to go to eight different stores to find formula and you wouldn't expect that in the United States of America. You inspect it in Russia or in China or in places that don't have a free market and yet, the explanation coming out of the White House is to check with your doctor?\par \par \uc2 I mean, listen, this is a \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  who campaigned against President Trump, frankly, suggesting everything that \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  was doing was wrong and from the supply chains to jobs to energy.\par \par \uc2 And what we're finding is that when you ask people on Main Street today, they were better off under the four years under \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  and it's coming home very, very clear.\par \par \uc2 You know, the people of Pennsylvania, they'll do their own vetting. You know, that -- you know, Kathy's got a a compelling personal story and that's what's resonating with people, but never underestimate the wisdom of voters. They'll be able to do the vetting uh properly in the commonwealth of Pennsylvania.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: The person I interviewed is unrecognizable to me in these comments and tweets to be honest. I'm shocked.\par \par \uc2 Anyway, thank you both.\par \par \uc2 When we come back, our own Lawrence Jones, LJ, with an exclusive report on Biden's secret migrant flights. He almost got arrested.\par \par \