l", entire chapter in the new book coming out about the arc of abortion opinion over the decades.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Oh, great. Well, Kellyanne, thank you so much. Great to see you tonight.\par \par \uc2 And, remember, if you cannot watch us live, make sure, set a series record on your DVR. I've helped a lot of you do this. I realized that. Don't miss us. You don't want to miss this. Remember, it's every weeknight at 10pm.\par \par \uc2 OK. Biden's big speech on inflation. Well, one about as well is expected today. But beyond the policy prescriptions, there was something more troubling about his appearance. What was it? Mollie Hemingway and Stephen Miller have reaction in moments. Stay there.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: All right. It was a bad decision in hindsight. But today, \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  held a press conference on the issue of runaway inflation. Why they think sending him out is ever going to be a good idea is beyond me.\par \par \uc2 But he said, it will be the first of many on the topic. And then he made a promise.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 JOE BIDEN\uc2 , PRESIDENT, UNITED STATES OF AMERICA: I know the families all across America are hurting because of inflation. I want every American to know that I'm taking inflation very seriously and it's my top domestic priority.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: OK. It's a little late, don't you think? A year ago, this show and others, we tried to warn you.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Inflation surges. The Democrats dream of a wild massive fake spendorama is slowly fading away as their own party's economic gurus are ratting them out now. Former Clinton Treasury Secretary \uc2 Larry Summers\uc2  has been warning about the dark clouds forming over the Biden economy for months.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Now, forget the ignored warnings. If you truly cared about resolving the crisis, you 