uc2 FDA\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 They have a Covaxin vaccine they have been sitting on for four months. That gives better protection against variants. They're just waiting on the bureaucracy. And they say the money is going to hyper-testing. We don't need to be hyper-tested immune people. We're feeding this testing- industrial complex of immune people. And the money's also going to Paxlovid, which is being overused right now in vaccinated, immune people who are low risk. The trial on Paxlovid shows that it saves live in unvaccinated, high-risk people, and yet it's being given out like candy right now to anybody with mild symptoms.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Yes, the Paxlovid, am I saying it right. I have a lot of friends that took it, it was given to them. But they are very low risk people, they had already had COVID, and they had already been vaccinated, and they had that. There just seems to be no rhyme nor reason to this. And of course, there are a lot of people who are concerned that this whole thing is being politicized for money, Dr. Makary, because there's no end to the money we have, despite, everything we know about what's going on in our economy. But Americans, I think, I get the sense they're just, they're done with this. They're done, done with the fearmongering.\par \par \uc2 MAKARY: Look, 100 million people are going to get RSV and Coxsackievirus and flu and other common cold viruses five to 20 times in their lifetime. But right now, 95 to 98 percent of the population has immunity. They have some circulating antibodies from natural or vaccinated immunity. That means you have got a 99.99 percent level of protection against COVID. Feel good about that protection.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Wow.\par \par \uc2 MAKARY: Live your life, and if you're low risk, COVID is not a serious concern.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Dr. Makary, wonderful to see you tonight. Thank you.\par \par \uc2 So what could be behind team Biden makes these predictions so far in advance? We know it's