Dana, I'm fully supportive of your birthday. And for once, just have Hemmer be nice to you. And this is really -- Bill, just be nice to her. We know a different Dana than you know.\par \par \uc2 STEVE DOOCY, FOX NEWS CHANNEL CO-HOST: And by the way, what's the line?\par \par \uc2 AINSLEY EARHARDT, FOX NEWS CHANNEL CO-HOST: We're so glad you were born. We love you. God bless you.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 PERINO: That is so nice. Thank you, everybody. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you. I was thinking, I turned 40 when we had just started THE FIVE and that was like a big thing.\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: I remember that birthday party.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: Yes. Down -- we're all the way down by the water. Remember the fireworks? They weren't my fireworks, but like another party's fireworks, but it looked like they were for me. It was right by the Statue of Liberty and it was an incredible decade.\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: You know, I think -- I don't think I've worked with anybody longer than you in my career.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: No, same. Hold my hand. Here we are. I think that's true.\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: Yes, this is hilarious.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: It's been wonderful.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: That's a really, really sweet package all the shout outs.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: Yes.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: Geraldo is at the bar, obviously.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: Yes. We love you, Dana.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: And you know --\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: You're an inspiration to all of us.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: Thank you.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: Even those of us who are older than you.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: \uc2 Sean Hannity\uc2  is really the reason I was able to come up to Fox.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: Really?\par \par \uc2 PERINO: You've heard the story before yet. You had -- they already had Karl Rove here. And I think that they felt like why do you need another Bush administration person. And he apparently told them -- he's like, no, I think she's different. Let me give her