se, if Biden does ever hold the rally I don't think many people would show up especially if it's raining.\par \par \uc2 He's probably the least popular president in the modern era and for good reason. We have record high inflation, a 41-year high, record high gas prices, the highest you've ever paid. The stock market is plummeting the economy now is shrinking. You're paying more for every product you buy in every store you go to.\par \par \uc2 Real wages are going down. The border is a disaster. War in Europe is waged and what is Joe doing, he's not even giving the Ukrainians enough in terms of military equipment to win the war against \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2 . And if you're keeping track like we are, \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  abandoned Americans behind enemy lines in Afghanistan, it is day 265.\par \par \uc2 This is just the tip of the iceberg. There's no law there's no order. They have defund, dismantle, no bail laws all over the place, and now, ahead of the midterms, Democrats are attempting to gain power by any means possible, including violent threats political intimidation.\par \par \uc2 They can't run on their record. They can't run on Biden's charm and charisma because it doesn't exist. They certainly can't run on its keen intellect.\par \par \uc2 So they are preying on the fears of the American people with some of the worst most dishonest tactics we have ever seen.\par \par \uc2 And coming up in during the show, we're going to show you how the left is attempting now to gin up hysteria including a campaign to dox, harass, intimidate the \uc2 U.S. Supreme Court\uc2  justices and their families going to their homes now.\par \par \uc2 But, first, we take you live on the ground in Greensburg, Pennsylvania, where president Trump is now speaking for Dr. Oz.\par \par \uc2 DONALD TRUMP\uc2 , FORMER PRESIDENT: Really incredible -- we did an incredible job and we got everything. And the person from the State Department came over and said, sir, that was the most amazing thing I've ever seen in government. I said actually, it was quite easy as I told you it would be.\par \par \uc2 When Republicans retake Congress, we should immediately pass legislation to ban the federal government from unloading plane loads and plane loads and truckloads and everything else of illegal aliens in American communities and into our homeland. This is our homeland that we love and we cherish.\par \par \uc2 Our country is full, we can't take it anymore. They are trying to destroy our country. We can't let that happen.\par \par \uc2 In addition to illegal immigration, Biden has blown out the refugee cap by 800 percent plus. Think of that. We had a cap on the number of people that could come into our country he's percent above the cap and that doesn't include the ones that come in legally which is frankly most of them, including bringing in tens of thousands of unvetted, unscreened foreign nationals from Afghanistan on the plains.\par \par \uc2 Hundreds of thousands of people and only three percent qualified to come in, some of them are terrorists. I've been very good at predicting, Did you ever hear that? I've been very good.\par \par \uc2 You're going to be paying for that. We are all going to be paying that for many years to come. Republicans should vote to restore my strong policy prohibiting refugee resettlement without the approval of local governments.\par \par \uc2 Under the defund the police mantra, they wanted to fund the police our high crime, which is all of them, Democrat-run cities are also being ravaged by the scourge of violent crime. It's violent.\par \par \uc2 Last year, Philadelphia, here we are and the Commonwealth of Pennsylvania, we have to talk about Philadelphia where frankly I went to college, a very wonderful place called the Wharton School of Finance.\par \par \uc2 Last year, Philadelphia broke all records for murders, listen to this, this is an American city, with 562 homicides, 562. That's a war zone. That's not a city.\par \par \uc2 The 32-year-old woman who was seven months pregnant was gunned down outside her home as she unloaded gifts from her baby shower. A few weeks ago in Pittsburgh, a 15-year-old boy was left dead after being shot in the head while riding his bicycle down the street. And in March, 50 bullets were fired into a crowded Pittsburgh party, leaving two people dead, eight others gravely wounded, dying most of them. And still more badly injured when they jumped out of windows to escape the slaughter -- they jumped out of windows they were so badly injured.\par \par \uc2 Democrats are the party of crime, the party of chaos and the party of death. They are. Whether you hate saying it or like saying it, they're the party of death.\par \par \uc2 Republicans are the party of law, order and life.\par \par \uc2 (CHEERS)\par \par \uc2 And you know what else the Republicans are? They're the party of the American Dream. They really are. They're the party of the American Dream which is being taken away from you. If you want to make our country safer for violent criminals, vote for the radical Democrats.\par \par \uc2 If you want to make it safer for your family, your children and for law abiding Americans, you must vote for Republicans. You must.\par \par \uc2 I don't know if you heard, you know our party is growing by leaps and bounds with the Hispanics, African-Americans, Asian-Americans, everybody. The party is a much different party than it was when I started six years ago, six years ago really.\par \par \uc2 And we have a much different party. We have a party some people say Trumpism, call it whatever you want, but it is indeed a party of safety and it's a party of common sense. Right here in Pennsylvania, that starts with nominating the man who has by far the best chance to win Pennsylvania's \uc2 U.S. Senate\uc2  race this fall, my friend, Dr. Mehmet Oz. He's a great man. Dr. Oz, I've known him a long time. His show is great. He's in that, he's on that screen. He's in the bedrooms of all those women telling them good and bad and they love him.\par \par \uc2 He came into a place where we had a lot of women sitting there waiting for something unrelated, they started going crazy. Is that Dr. Oz? That's Dr. Oz.\par \par \uc2 But he's taking a lot of horrible unfair and untrue shots. You know, they're spending millions and millions. This is Wall Street people, they have plenty of money, plenty of money. They're spending millions of dollars and treating them very unfairly.\par \par \uc2 Dr. Oz has led an enormously successful career on television and now he's running to save our country, just like I do, from the radical left lunatics and maniacs. Dr. Oz is a man who truly believes in Make America Great Again or the MAGA movement. He believes it 100 percent and he is in love with our country.\par \par \uc2 He's supported by \uc2 Sean Hannity\uc2  and we all love \uc2 Sean Hannity\uc2 , Rick Perry, and very importantly, he's supported by somebody known as me. He's supported by me.\par \par \uc2 As your senator, Oz will fight to end illegal immigration, end sanctuary cities and put dangerous criminals behind bars that's what he wants to do it's going to stop the Democrats socialists and communists and confront China like no senator in the history of our state.\par \par \uc2 And by the way, you have a senator who is very weaker in China, this guy Toomey. I wouldn't give him my endorsement so he couldn't run. This guy Toomey is so bad on China, I said, so let me ask you a question, Pat, just let me ask you this question, a stupid question. China's been ripping us off for many years, you've done nothing about it.\par \par \uc2 If they're charging us a hundred percent tariff, are we allowed to charge them a hundred percent? No, sir, that's not free trade. Are we allowed to charge them 50 percent, Pat? No, no. Twenty-five percent? No, can't charge them anything.\par \par \uc2 I said, there's something wrong with this guy. This is your senator and I wouldn