: But there's still a lot of work to do.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Andrea and Greg, both of you, first of all, thanks for coming. But Andrea, you just have to get back at it, OK? Don't let this stop you, OK? They're going to keep trying to do stuff like this, I imagine. But you have to run again if this doesn't pan out, which it looks like it might not. But thank you for alerting us to all of these developments in West Virginia.\par \par \uc2 And the president makes a startling admission that explains a lot coming up. And will your church be safe this weekend from radical activists? Raymond Arroyo has all of this in Friday Follies coming up.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 ASHLEY STROHMIER, FOX NEWS CORRESPONDENT: Welcome to FOX News live. I'm Ashley Strohmier in New York.\par \par \uc2 President Biden has authorized the shipment of another $150 million in military assistance for Ukraine. Biden said the latest spending means his administration has nearly exhausted what Congress authorized for Ukraine in March, and he called on lawmakers to swiftly approve a more than $33 billion spending package that will last through the end of September.\par \par \uc2 And the getaway vehicle used by Casey White who is wanted for murder in Alabama and the jail official, Vicky White, who is suspected of helping him escape after a jailhouse romance, was found in an impound lot in Tennessee. The vehicle was found in a rural area off Interstate 65. It's about 100 miles from the jail in Florence, Alabama. The sheriff said Vicky's handcuffs, jail keys, and radio were found in the car. There had also appeared to be an attempt to spray paint the vehicle.\par \par \uc2 I'm Ashley Strohmier. Back to THE INGRAHAM ANGLE.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: It's Friday, thank goodness, and that means it's time for Friday Follies. And for that, we turn to FOX News Contributor Raymond Arroyo.\par \par \uc2 All right, Ray, President Biden has made a fairly astounding admission.\par \par \uc2 RAYM