erate. So this is not a surprise, but I do think Americans are starting to have enough of this stuff and that's why they're going to get killed in November.\par \par \uc2 Kellyanne, when I played \uc2 Chuck Schumer\uc2  threatening Gorsuch and Kavanagh, was that a threat? Because I think it was.\par \par \uc2 CONWAY: Yes, it was and as for \uc2 Chuck Schumer\uc2 , I want this old white guy telling me what to do with my body, Sean, and how to think.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: That's very woke of you. Go ahead.\par \par \uc2 CONWAY: No, it was a threat. It was a threat. He went to their place at work and threatened them.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Right.\par \par \uc2 CONWAY: By the way, have you noticed? There's always cameras involved. They have to bother Ted and Heidi Cruz at dinner. \uc2 Kirstjen Nielsen\uc2 , the secretary of homeland, they've always got their camera out and then they go, which makes you wonder.\par \par \uc2 But I think it's all escalated now and it's because of something you said earlier, which is that people are lying about what would happen if in fact that opinion holds, and Roe versus Wade no longer exists. Of course, abortion will be accessible.\par \par \uc2 People are lying about that and the left benefits from the fact that a majority of Americans when you ask them what did Roe versus Wade actually provide, they get it wrong. The Democrats love that.\par \par \uc2 People know Planned Parenthood gets a half a billion dollars in taxpayer money. They were caught selling fetal tissue and baby body parts a few years ago. They're for ninth month abortion. They're for sex election abortion. They're for taxpayer-funded abortion.\par \par \uc2 I would ask every liberal out there, every pro-choicer, just -- can you think of one abortion you think is a bad idea? Just one. Tell us. Describe it to us.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: We have many states that are allowed -- Kellyanne, we put up on the states in this union that allow abortion up until the moment of birt