d to those groups who are likely to help the Democrats. They think criminals deserve a break and that you never do.\par \par \uc2 And for the next six months, they're going to scream and wail, like you heard Elizabeth Warren the other day about everything, except stuff that will actually help you and your family.\par \par \uc2 So as the Dow was plummeting today, this is what CNN was locked on.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED FEMALE: Lordy, there are more tapes. Newly released audio reveals House Minority Leader Kevin McCarthy discussed actually removing \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  from office. Melanie, how many more tapes could there be out there?\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED FEMALE: Well, if you're Kevin McCarthy, you're hoping there are zero more tapes.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: They'll encourage people to riot and smash things, use mail-in ballots, stuff the ballot boxes, of course, they'll do that as well. And one of the most shameful things I think that's happened in the past 50 years is that so many who spent their careers pretending to be Republicans have abandoned the supporters who voted for them or read their lousy articles in the first place.\par \par \uc2 Rather than working to replace this doddering fool with an America First leader, they'd rather prop up radical incompetence. Their hatred of Trump trumps what's best for America.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED FEMALE: People were betrayed by a sitting president of the United States.\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED MALE: Now we gather due to a selfish man's injured pride.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Thanks, Mitt. Now, remember when Biden claimed he was just a guy from Scranton, who cared about the little people.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 BIDEN: He sees the world from Park Avenue. I had seen it from Scranton. Who is looking out for the average person out there. People I grew up with in