e grand jury there has been looking into \uc2 Hunter Biden\uc2 's business dealings and they have been asking people who is the Big Guy and the Big Guy, we know from Tony Bobulinski is \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 And remember, Tony Bobulinski is another business partner of Hunter's who \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  met.\par \par \uc2 CARLSON: Amazing, a little weird. They made all this money from Ukraine, and now we're sending billions to Ukraine. I'm not saying there is any connection.\par \par \uc2 DEVINE: Funny about that.\par \par \uc2 CARLSON: It is weird. Miranda Devine, I appreciate your coming on tonight. Great to see you.\par \par \uc2 DEVINE: Thanks so much.\par \par \uc2 CARLSON: So our triple vaccinated and boosted space czar, \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  of California, Willie Brown's ex-girlfriend has just made a stunning announcement about her health. And of course, we cover all stunning announcements about \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 , if that's her real name, straight ahead.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 CARLSON: \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  doesn't have a lot of fixed beliefs. Okay, none -- well, one, really. The one thing \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  believes is that the COVID vaccine works perfectly and if you don't take it, you're a criminal.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 KAMALA HARRIS\uc2  (D), VICE PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES: Here's the thing: Getting vaccinated is the single best defense against COVID-19 and its variants. It's the single best defense.\par \par \uc2 I do believe that the act of getting vaccinated is the very essence, the very essence of what the Bible tells us when it says, Love thy neighbor. Right?\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 CARLSON: It's like a religious observance, it is like a sacrament. It's like transubstantiation and \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 , who has never actually had a job, knows a lot about Medicine.\par \par \uc2 So that's the set up to today's story, which you can already guess, which