rive cars until they're 16. We don't let them vote or reach the age of majority until they're 18. You can't even buy a beer until you're 21, at least illegally.\par \par \uc2 And yet we're going to allow minor children to decide to have life- altering, gender-altering surgeries before they are even 18 years old. This is absolute insanity. Parents should be standing up against this. It's child abuse in my opinion to be having surgeries like this before you are 18 years old.\par \par \uc2 Now, once you reach the age of majority, if you make that decision for yourself, I think you have the right to make that decision. But the idea that our tax dollars should be funding children who are deciding to have permanent altering surgeries like this -- look, we all have kids. We all have been teenagers. We all know how crazy some of the ideas that we have when we're 13 or 14 years old end up feeling like by the time you're 19 or 20 years old.\par \par \uc2 It's why we don't allow minors to be prosecuted as adults if they commit crimes when they are young because we understand that the brain is still developing and we shouldn't hold young people to the standards of the same age as adults. And by the way, imagine if you were saying right now, Sean or Rachel, hey, I think that every 15 year old should be able to get married to whoever they want in this country, people would lose their minds. And we're going to allow this with tax dollars in the United States? It's child abuse in my opinion.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: I can't even believe we're debating this topic, but here we are.\par \par \uc2 Clay, thank you. Rachel, we'll be watching in the morning. We appreciate you being with us.\par \par \uc2 More HANNITY right after the break.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: All right. Unfortunately, that is all the time we have left this evening. As always, thank you for joining us. You make the show possible.\par \par \uc2 Now, remember, we hope you will set your DVR a