hows she's involved with. Watch.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED FEMALE: I identify as like a biromantic asexual. I want to use my content to go deeper. I want to add the pockets of the LGBTQ community that you don't see. I was like - I want to get day in advance.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: I think she said like three or four times in the span of about 20 seconds. How about we like stop saying like, Amala, Reaction quickly?\par \par \uc2 EKPUNOBI: Yes, clearly she should be at the head of teaching children. It's amazing how many identities they come up with, and there will be more. And it shows you, how important things like sex and race and gender are to these people, when we should be focusing on moral character integrity and values.\par \par \uc2 That's what \uc2 Disney\uc2  used to do with their stronghold on the American childhood. They need to go back to that.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Chris, Amala, great to see you both tonight. Thank you.\par \par \uc2 Oh, and now to the left's newest COVID charade. Well, I don't know if you heard this. Currently, some of the elites in Washington are coming down with the case of the asymptomatics.\par \par \uc2 Now, everyone from Attorney General \uc2 Merrick Garland\uc2  to Biden's Commerce Secretary \uc2 Gina Raimondo\uc2  to \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 's communications director have tested positive for COVID in the last few days.\par \par \uc2 So what was the root of this now rare outbreak? Well, it looks like the annual confab bringing the press and some of their favorite politicians together was the root of the problem. It's called the Gridiron club dinner.\par \par \uc2 Now, I remember a time when holding big events like this were called the height of irresponsibility because they put lives in danger. And further, it was the fault of those who took the measured risk to attend.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED MALE: These super spreader events 