ortion industry that it will do nothing but smear those asking questions.\par \par \uc2 So where is the decency? We all recoil in the horror over the grizzly killings of innocent children in Ukraine. But where is the outcry over what's being done to these poor little babies? Not a word from the supposedly strong Catholic, Biden, and nary a peep from D.C. Mayor Muriel Bowser. After days of silence from D.C. officials, "Daily Wire" reporter Mary Margaret Olohan went to the clinic in question seeking answers. But even she never expected to find what she encountered. Mary Margaret Olohan joins me now. Tell us what you saw when you got to the clinic.\par \par \uc2 MARY MARGARET OLOHAN, REPORTER, "DAILY WIRE": Thanks, Laura. I never expected in a million years to see what I saw yesterday, and it will probably stay with me for the rest of my life. So I went to Washington Surgi-Clinic which is in Foggy Bottom in D.C. It's on the fourth floor of a big office building. And I got up there and went inside and was chatting with some of the nurses, or the abortion clinic staff that were in there. They told me I could not talk to the abortionist, Dr. Santangelo. They said he wasn't there which I have reason to believe they were lying about since the waiting room was full of patients. And when I went outside the door to leave, I bumped into a woman who told me that she was in the middle of having an abortion right then and there.\par \par \uc2 And Laura, I cannot tell you how upsetting and how moving this situation was. She was with a man who I assumed to be her boyfriend or her husband. His eyes were all right, he looked like he was crying. She was leaning on the wall kind of heaving and moaning. She was in a lot of pain. And I said what are you doing here, what's going on? And she said I'm having an abortion.\par \par \uc2 And I was really confused because it was strange language, and I looked at her and I could see that her stomach was huge and it was really firm. And I said, did you already have it, or what do you mean? She said I'm having it right now. And I'm standing there and horror looking at her, realizing that her baby is being aborted as we speak.\par \par \uc2 And right at that moment, an abortion clinic worker opened the door of the clinic, stuck her head out, and said don't talk to her, don't talk to her. And she was trying to get the people to go inside, and talking over me so I couldn't be heard. And I didn't have a lot of time, but I told them, please, talk to me. If you want to share your stories, my name is Mary Margaret, and I work for "The Daily Wire." And I didn't have a lot of time to give them much more, and then they went back into the clinic.\par \par \uc2 So I go downstairs and I get into the lobby, and I'm just standing there, and suddenly it hits me like a wave that this woman was having an abortion, she was in the middle of it. I talked to pro-life doctors who told me later that she was in the beginning stages and it looked like she was about to head in there for an induction abortion, and that the abortionist had set her up to make it easier for him to reach in there and get the baby.\par \par \uc2 And I'm walking to my car in the rain, and I just was overcome. Like, what should I have said? Should have said something differently? So I have asked her if she wanted to be there? And I'm realizing that this doctor who is aborting her baby, we know that he was recorded in 2012 saying that he would allow a baby to die if it was born alive during his abortion.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Mary, this is an undercover video, the one you just referenced from 2012, where, and I don't even want to call this individual a doctor, but he explained his process. Watch.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 DR. SANTANGELO: Hopefully we can get this pregnancy out intact, but it doesn't always happen that way.\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED FEMALE: Does it ever move or anything when it comes out?\par \par \uc2 SANTANGELO: That's 